+ * @file      stm32wl_subghz_hal.c
+ *
+ * @brief     STM32WL on-chip SUBGHZ HAL implementation
+ *
+ * Drives SUBGHZSPI, PWR NSS/RFBUSY, RCC radio reset, and EXTI 44 directly
